## Conclusion

FreqCa represents a significant advancement in making large-scale Diffusion Transformers practical for real-time applications. By unifying reuse and forecasting paradigms through frequency decomposition and introducing the memory-efficient CRF strategy, it provides a robust path toward high-speed, low-resource generative AI. Future research may extend these principles to video generation, where temporal redundancy offers even greater opportunities for acceleration.

