Methodological stance:

Our goal is not to exhaustively rank models but to characterize confounds that dis-

tort evaluation ﬁdelity and deployment reliability. We therefore prioritize interpretable

contrasts over omnibus signiﬁcance testing, report eﬀect sizes and uncertainty per

scenario, and emphasize whether changes reﬂect capability or style. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
