L189: # Hulu-Med: A Transparent Generalist Model towards Holistic Medical Vision-Language Understanding
L190: 
L191: 【71†🤗 Hulu-Med-Flash-Preview-27B†huggingface.co】| 【72†🤗 Hulu-Med-30A3†huggingface.co】 |【73†🤗 Hulu-Med-235A22†huggingface.co】 | 【74†🤗 Hulu-Med-4B†huggingface.co】 |【75†🤗 Hulu-Med-7B†huggingface.co】 | 【76†🤗 Hulu-Med-14B†huggingface.co】 |【77†🤗 Hulu-Med-32B†huggingface.co】 |【78†🔮 ModelScope Models†modelscope.cn】 | 【79†📊 Demo (Now Open)†79aafa693c9637a31d.gradio.live】
L192: ## 🔥 News
L193:   * [2026-04-01] 🚀 We released 【71†🤗 Hulu-Med-Flash-Preview-27B†huggingface.co】. This version features shorter CoT reasoning for faster throughput and achieves an impressive 64.5 on HealthBench (43.7 on Hard set)! ⚡
L194:   * [2026-2-24] 🏆 We have released our 【73†🤗 Hulu-Med-235A22†huggingface.co】 and 【72†🤗 Hulu-Med-30BA3†huggingface.co】. Please have a try.
L195:   * [2025-11-27] ⚡ Hulu-Med is now compatible with the latest vLLM, offering faster inference and tensor parallel support! Thank you all for your patience and feedback 💪 【80†see here for installation】
L196:   * [2025-11-18] 🎊 We released Hulu-Med-4B, a lightweight model with strong multimodal and text reasoning abilities that surpasses MedGemma-4B and Lingshu-7B!
L197:   * [2025-11-01] 📊 Releasing our new evaluation code, MedUniEval! Built on MedEvalKit, MedUniEval is designed for the comprehensive evaluation of medical visual-language models across various modalities—including text, 2D, 3D, and video. More benchmarks are coming soon. Some processed evaluation data are available 【78†here†modelscope.cn】.
L198:   * [2025-10-16] 🚀 Demo Is Live! We've just deployed a demo and we'd love for you to try it! Your insights and feedback are crucial for helping us improve the model in the next version.
L199:   * [2025-10-15] 🎉 Hulu-Med now supports Transformers integration! HuggingFace-compatible models released with simplified loading and inference. Integration with VLLM is ongoing. The HF models are now available in the main branch on Hugging Face.
L200:   * The model has been updated in the main branch of our Hugging Face repository. You can now load it directly using `AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained` - the weights will be automatically downloaded. For users in regions with limited access, you can set the HF mirror environment variable to ensure reliable downloads:
L201: 
L202:     export HF_ENDPOINT=https://hf-mirror.com
L203:   * [2025-10-08] Hulu-Med models and inference code released!
L204: ## 📖 Overview
L205: 
L206: Hulu-Med is a transparent medical vision-language model that unifies understanding across diverse modalities including medical text, 2D/3D images, and videos. Built with a focus on transparency and accessibility, Hulu-Med achieves state-of-the-art performance on 30 medical benchmarks while being trained entirely on public data.
L207: ### Key Features
L208:   * 🌟 Holistic Multimodal Understanding: Seamlessly processes medical text, 2D images, 3D volumes, and surgical videos
L209:   * 🔓 Fully Transparent: Complete open-source pipeline including data curation, training code, and model weights
L210:   * 📊 State-of-the-Art Performance: Outperforms leading open-source models and competes with proprietary systems
L211:   * ⚡ Efficient Training: Only 4,000-40,000 GPU hours required for 7B-32B variants
L212:   * 🗂️ Comprehensive Coverage: Trained on 16.7M samples spanning 12 anatomical systems and 14 imaging modalities
L213:   * 🤗 Transformers Native: Now with native HuggingFace Transformers support for easier integration
L214: ### Comprehensive Data Coverage
L215: 
L216: Our training corpus encompasses:
L217:   * 12 Major Anatomical Systems: Multi-System, Skin/Integumentary, Respiratory, Cellular/Tissue Level, Digestive, Nervous, Cardiovascular, Musculoskeletal, Reproductive, Urinary, Whole Body, Endocrine, Immune/Lymphatic, and Hematologic systems
L218:   * 14 Medical Imaging Modalities: CT, MRI, X-Ray, Ultrasound, PET, OCT, Endoscopy, Microscopy, Histopathology, Fundus, Dermoscopy, Angiography, Digital Photograph, and Medical Chart
L219:   * Diverse Downstream Tasks: Medical Dialogue, Anomaly Detection, Prognosis Prediction, Treatment Planning, Surgical Skill Assessment, Education, Medical Report Generation, Surgical Phase Recognition, Medical Computation, and more
L220: ## 🚀 Model Zoo
L221: 
L222: We provide three model variants with different parameter scales:
L223: Model  | Parameters  | LLM Base  | Training Cost  | HuggingFace  | ModelScope
L224: --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---
L225: Hulu-Med-4B  | 4B  | Qwen3-VL-4B  | ~1,000 GPU hours  | 【74†🤗 Link†huggingface.co】  | 【81†🔮 Link†modelscope.cn】
L226: Hulu-Med-7B  | 7B  | Qwen2.5-7B  | ~4,000 GPU hours  | 【75†🤗 Link†huggingface.co】  | 【81†🔮 Link†modelscope.cn】
