L15: ### 【10†Latent-space Attacks for Refusal Evasion in Language Models†arxiv.org】
L16: 
L17: Giorgio Piras, Raffaele Mura, Fabio Brau, Maura Pintor, Luca Oneto, Fabio Roli, Battista Biggio
L18: 
L19: This paper recasts refusal suppression as a latent-space evasion attack against linear probes, introducing Controlled Latent-space Evasion to push model representations into the compliant region.
L20: 
L21: arXiv 2026 ·【10†Paper†arxiv.org】 ·【11†Project Page†latentevasion.github.io】 ·【12†Code†github.com】
L22: 【13†Image: Thumbnail for SOM Directions are Better than One: Multi-Directional Refusal Suppression in Language Models】
