L24: 
L25: Giorgio Piras, Raffaele Mura, Fabio Brau, Luca Oneto, Fabio Roli, Battista Biggio
L26: 
L27: This paper uses Self-Organizing Maps to extract multiple refusal directions in language models, showing that multi-directional ablation can suppress refusal more effectively than a single-direction baseline.
L28: 
