L32: 
L33: Raffaele Mura, Giorgio Piras, Kamile Lukosiute, Maura Pintor, Amin Karbasi, Battista Biggio
L34: 
L35: This paper introduces LatentBreak, a white-box jailbreak attack that creates natural, low-perplexity adversarial prompts through latent-space feedback.
